msgid "Google wouldn't send adb to this computer (it said {code}). Google blocks Android downloads in some countries. If you get platform-tools another way, pick its adb.exe or zip instead."
msgstr "Google tidak dapat mengirimkan adb ke komputer ini (respons: {code}). Google memblokir unduhan Android di beberapa negara. Jika Anda mendapatkan platform-tools dengan cara lain, pilih adb.exe atau zip tersebut."

